	Here it is a FREE Unix-Like shell program.  The program is in ARC51
format.  It includes PC-SHELL.EXE, PC-SHELL.DOC, and SMALL.EXE.  VERY NICE!
If you find any problems with it please MAIL me and I will forward to the
Author.  Or write decvax!cwruecmp!ncoast!kent.


